81 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 60 0 R
/T (The takeaway for Research and Development \(R&D\) professionals is that acne is not merely a teenage rite of passage; it is a widespread, chronic condition across age groups and geographies, with an increasing population of adult sufferers in Europe and North America. This shifting epidemiology drives a strong demand for new acne solutions that cater to adults as well as adolescents [2].)
/E (The takeaway for Research and Development \(R&D\) professionals is that acne is not merely a teenage rite of passage; it is a widespread, chronic condition across age groups and geographies, with an increasing population of adult sufferers in Europe and North America. This shifting epidemiology drives a strong demand for new acne solutions that cater to adults as well as adolescents [2].)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
